<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 8.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   115/117   122/124     UNQ     236/238</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  121/123   126/129   238/242   248/255</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS -  Bunkers fell on Wednesday, with thin enquiries but healthy supplies, traders said. A local trader heard sold at least 2,000 tonnes of 380-cst at $122 and was willing to offer lower at $121. But cargo prices steady, although seen under pressure as U.S. arb open and Kuwait spot supplies heading to Singapore.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
